From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Victor Momplet <mompletvictor@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 17:41:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(training): change notes on a suggested workout
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

On a suggestion's review each exercise can carry a note («no tengo aerobike») and the
session one for the whole («demasiado estáticos, más dinámicos»). With notes, the
secondary button becomes «Cambiar con mis notas»: Claude revises the proposal as left
(edits included), replacing only what the notes cover and keeping the rest as is. Notes
already acted on are still heard by later proposals of the same sheet. A cancelled or
failed revision keeps the proposal and its notes on screen.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
